{"symbol":"M.RO","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T19:19:06Z","info":{"address1":"365 Calea Grivitei","address2":"Sector 1","city":"Bucharest","country":"Romania","phone":"40 749 999 023","fax":"40 212 094 050","website":"https://www.medlife.ro","industry":"Medical Care Facilities","industryKey":"medical-care-facilities","industryDisp":"Medical Care Facilities","sector":"Healthcare","sectorKey":"healthcare","sectorDisp":"Healthcare","longBusinessSummary":"Med Life S.A., a private healthcare provider, provides integrated medical services through its clinics and hospitals in Romania. The company offers outpatient units and diagnostic imaging services; consultations with general practitioners and specialists; diagnostic imaging tests; day hospitalization services; hospitalization and surgical treatment services; medical and surgical specialties; maternal and child health dedicated services; and stem cell bank. It also provides laboratory services, such as biochemistry, pathological anatomy, molecular biology and genetics, hematology, immunology, microbiology, cytology, and toxicology; healthcare packages; a range of dental services; and fitness services and wellness facilities through the Sweat Concept network and Sanopass platform. In addition, the company is involved in the development of building projects; insurance broker; rental activities; and distribution and retail sale of pharmaceutical products in specialized stores. Med Life S.A. was incorporated in 1996 and is headquartered in Bucharest, Romania.","fullTimeEmployees":6525,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Mihail  Marcu","age":55,"title":"Chairman & CEO","yearBorn":1970,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Oana-Alina  Irinoiu-Titu","age":32,"title":"CFO & Investor Relations Manager","yearBorn":1993,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Nicolae  Marcu","age":57,"title":"Chief Healthcare & Operations Officer and Director","yearBorn":1968,"exer